    "k395": "[74] David Cahn, “AI's $600B Question,” Sequoia Capital, Jun 2024 — <a href=\"https://www.sequoiacap.com/article/ais-600b-question/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">sequoiacap.com</a>",
